    <!-- About -->
    <string name="about_description">
        In Vorkuta-5, snow covers the streets and the windows of the research institute stay shut. Asya notices the names that go uncalled, even when the rest of the town carries on. Tosya is with her, as she has always been.\n\nSome people are simply gone. No one seems concerned.\n\nOutside the window, a bird flies past. Farther away, a faint signal continues toward the cosmos. Asya thinks of Tosya, who has been close to her for longer than she can explain.
    </string>
